From efce6e5223b3797c84e2922342c14df2be9adeef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NEXUS Frontend <nexus-frontend@local>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 12:20:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add read-only frontend UI for NEXUS feed

- New public/index.html, styles.css, app.js: static dashboard that
  polls GET /api/health and GET /api/agent/feed to render the live
  autonomous feed, scheduler status, and cycle telemetry.
- Frontend never calls POST /api/agent/init or /api/agent/tick -- it
  only reads existing state, it does not mutate agent behavior.
- src/api/app.ts: mount express.static(public) + SPA fallback AFTER
  the existing /api router, so it can never shadow an API route.
  No changes to agent, scheduler, discovery, editorial, generation,
  memory, or persistence logic. Full existing test suite (42/42)
  and tsc build verified green with this change applied.
---
